; Tank (#1202, a no-ledge stage): a walled steel tank. A centre floor (x=-290..290) and two
; outer floors (x=+-370..+-760), top y=320, split by two 80 px drains at x=+-330, with a
; mud patch across the centre floor and a bridge over it (top y=154). Walls to the view
; edge leave no outer end; the two drains are floored (closed stage).
